A car's entry time is recorded only if it had no entry before, and a car's entry slot is cleared only when it is successfully exited. The default of -1 makes that slot look empty after a car is removed. An exit on an already-empty slot simply skips, so that second attempt and any later ones produce no fee. The times always increase, so the difference between exit time and entry time is positive for a true exit.

